+    // RSASSA-PSS with an id-RSASSA-PSS certificate key: the code points Chrome
+    // offers (0x0904..0x0906). A door binds its clearance to the ClientHello
+    // that earned it, and the browser offers these; a transport that cannot
+    // offer them presents a JA4 the browser does not have, and the clearance
+    // is refused on replay. Additive: nothing selects them unless asked for
+    // by name in a sigalgs list.
+    {SSL_SIGN_RSA_PSS_PSS_SHA256, EVP_PKEY_RSA_PSS, NID_undef, &EVP_sha256,
